# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# ql-label-printer - files never sent into a Docker build
# Date: 2026-11-08 18:05 GMT
# Developer: Ash @ Distant Galaxy (@distantgalaxy-net)
# The image only needs requirements.txt and app/. Keeping data/ out
# guarantees saved settings, passwords and icons can't end up in a
# published image.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
.git/
.github/
docs/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
